{"id":"n28118-2-7","stage":4,"title":"가닥 · 股","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28118-2-7-1","ko":"어제 먹은 냉면 괜찮았지?","zh":"昨天吃的冷面不错吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"먹은","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹은","audio":"/audio/1d859792bc976ecdc401.mp3"}},{"text":"냉면","meaning":"冷面","explanation":"냉면：冷面。","readings":[{"term":"냉면","audio":"/audio/0bd080fa0243c64881e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32777","senseId":"1","lemma":"냉면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냉면","audio":"/audio/0bd080fa0243c64881e5.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮았지?","meaning":"不错","explanation":"괜찮다：不错；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"1","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮았지","audio":"/audio/ad597d361201fd27f4a4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"0bd080fa0243c648","term":"냉면","zh":"冷面","audio":"/audio/0bd080fa0243c64881e5.mp3","entryId":"32777","definition":"一种将面条用凉汤或辛奇汤汁泡着吃，或用辣椒酱拌着吃的食物。","pronunciation":["냉ː면"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3",